@EatsAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5225

### Create an account
POST {{EatsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alex",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "userName": "alexj",
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "password": "SavorlyPass123!"
}

### Sign in
POST {{EatsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "password": "SavorlyPass123!"
}

### Get current user (replace with the accessToken from sign-up or sign-in)
GET {{EatsAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json
